        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Cosmonious High",
        "extract": "Cosmonious High is a virtual reality adventure game developed and published in 2022 by Owlchemy Labs for SteamVR, HTC Vive, and Oculus Quest 2 through Windows in which students attend a colorful and chaotic high school in space with a cast of quirky alien classmates. A port for PlayStation VR2 was released alongside the system's launch on February 22, 2023.",
